<em>MacRumors</em> this week leaked the <a href="https://www.macrumors.com/2026/09/25/new-ipad-mini-homepod-mini-apple-tv-leaked/">next iPad mini, HomePod mini, and Apple TV 4K models</a>, all of which are likely to be announced this October as part of <a href="https://www.macrumors.com/2026/09/22/apple-event-october-2026-what-to-expect/">another wave of product launches</a> including an <a href="https://www.macrumors.com/2026/09/22/apple-working-on-an-all-new-operating-system/">all-new operating system</a> to accompany some of the new hardware.<br/>
<br/>
